<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team about your journey to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Arrival_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We’re committed to getting you to your destination on time.<br />
<br />
Occasional flight changes are necessary.&nbsp;While we do our best to avoid them wherever possible, I understand how inconvenient schedule changes are and I’m sorry to hear about the impact this had on your planned itinerary.<br />
<br />
We know how important it is to let you know straight away when changes happen. We sent you an email on &lt;date&gt; advising you of the change.<br />
<br />
While we will do our best to provide you with clear and timely announcements, I’m sorry that on this occasion we didn’t quite meet your expectations.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>-If requesting compensation add: -</em></strong><br />
<br />
As you were provided notification within a reasonable timeframe, unfortunately I’m unable to meet your request for a refund for your unexpected expenses.<br />
<br />
While these expenses may not be covered by us, your travel insurance policy may cover these sorts of situations.<br />
<br />
Please let me know if you’d like me to provide you with an insurance letter to assist with a claim – we're here to help.</body>
